---
app: outline
title: A talk about the document that is the link
---
- The document is the link
  - What that means
    - No account, no upload, no server that holds your words
    - Copy the address and you have copied the document
  - What it costs
    - A link can be long; a QR code holds about three thousand characters
    - Anyone with the link has the document, so share it like a key
  - Ten apps on one kernel
    - Words, outlines, slides, numbers, drawings, diagrams, animation, dates, maps
  - Questions {.from label=last}
    - Keep three minutes

~ What it costs -> What that means: the other side of
